 (text "POWER STAGE AND DC LINK  (Q1/Q3 left cell, Q2/Q4 right cell; Kelvin = source pad 2 end, see notes)" (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 878b3872-6ba8-5421-825e-853bdeeede62))
 (text "C1-C12: 1 uF 100 V X7S 0805 local (6 per cell at the HS drains)   C13-C36: 10 uF 100 V X7S 1210 bank" (at 40.64 165.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f450c00c-2fce-589e-b008-4aff79758db2))
 (text "DC+ (DCP)" (at 33.02 38.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e3031dd7-8eee-5926-b132-c665ab2013c5))
 (text "DC- (DCN)" (at 33.02 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9e5b411d-f306-5e7b-b85d-90f468fafb06))
 (text "D8: DC link present, R39: 100 k bleeder" (at 431.80 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 73261d7e-93d8-5d23-b48b-94a0e4e60bf1))
 (text "NTC (on the right HS cell, DC- referenced) and J6: LS domain, high voltage" (at 474.98 50.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 42afc003-04f9-5ccd-8442-bf260634b582))
 (text "MEASUREMENT LANDINGS (probe pads: tip SIG, spring ground GND at 2.5 / 5.0 mm)" (at 25.40 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 625fc6d0-85d5-5367-a99a-16e8fb37003e))
 (text "TP1/TP5 D: Vds Q3/Q4   TP2/TP6 K: vKS (Kelvin vs power source)   TP3/TP7 G: Vgs Q3/Q4   TP4/TP8 H: Vgs Q1/Q2 (isolated probe)   TP9-11 / TP12-14: ISO, VDD, S of supply A / B   TP15: 12 V   TP16: DC link" (at 25.40 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 53e72e38-4bda-5b1c-82c6-9636a9395ff8))
 (text "GATE DRIVER U1 (2EDF7275K): input filters, VDDI, separate turn-on / turn-off networks, local decoupling" (at 25.40 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 583fb786-b868-5b12-a51d-b83985b7f8c0))
 (text "SLDON = GNDI: input-side LDO on" (at 154.94 307.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 82844dc3-e1c1-50bc-9157-df213833c11b))
 (text "R_ON (R5/R7) 0.75 R, R_OFF (R6/R8) 0 R, R_G,i (R1-R4) 0.5 R: 2.0 R on / 0.5 R + diode off per transistor" (at 154.94 309.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fea80adb-4149-579c-9f69-feb169ff1901))
 (text "GATE SUPPLY A: MGN1S1208MC 12 V -> 8 V iso, TPS7A4901 6.29 V, TLV431 sets S = VEE + 1.24 V  (S = SW Kelvin)" (at 299.72 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e0021cf5-5ea0-59f4-a5a3-3f637839cfe4))
 (text "GATE SUPPLY B: MGN1S1208MC 12 V -> 8 V iso, TPS7A4901 6.29 V, TLV431 sets S = VEE + 1.24 V  (S = DCN Kelvin)" (at 299.72 312.42 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a4ebe40a-37bc-5ecc-986b-04c5185fc4c1))
 (text "PRIMARY: fan connector, 12 V LED" (at 25.40 330.20 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 94ae3f66-ab82-5894-8b3f-6f265bf55947))
 (text "MOUNTING: H1-H4 board corners, H5-H8 heatsink (Fischer LAM 4 K 50 12 on an Al spreader, board-only item HS1)" (at 25.40 375.92 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2787282e-4494-509e-8e2f-7d360298fa7f))
 (text "Nets: DCP = DC+, DCN = DC-, SW = switch node.  The high-side gate reference S_A is the SW net via the Kelvin traces (source pad 2 of Q1/Q2), the low-side reference S_B is the DCN net via the Kelvin traces of Q3/Q4." (at 25.40 406.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 51bbac3b-1272-5423-bd83-358e479679f7))
 (text "Kelvin routing (PCB): Q1/Q2 pad 2 -> L2 collector -> L4 return under the L3 gate trunk -> C100/C101 node; Q3/Q4 pad 2 -> L2 collector -> C102/C103 node.  The schematic shows them as SW / DCN." (at 25.40 411.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6d25d573-abae-5a9e-8420-5427a43feb50))
 (text "U2/U3 TPS7A4901DGNR: EN tied to IN, NR/SS open (CNR = 0 allowed), DNC and NC open, exposed pad to VEE; VOUT = 1.185 V (1 + R_top/R_bot)." (at 25.40 416.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cac0a083-6f10-524a-b4af-d44b97104d74))
 (text "TP1-TP16 are probe landings (copper pads, no part).  TP2/TP6 measure Kelvin vs power-source copper of the same net (di/dt sensing).  J6 and all TPs in supply A/B are in high-voltage domains." (at 25.40 421.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 168731d2-6817-5aab-9f87-925eafb9b814))
